[{"text": "The assembly will hear an address by His", "start": 2.399, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "Excellency Emerson Damo Munangua,", "start": 5.759, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "President of the Republic of Zimbabwe.", "start": 9.679, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 13.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 15.759, "duration": 6.041}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 18.8, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Your excellency", "start": 47.52, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Dr. Raman,", "start": 50.399, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "President of the 8 first session of the", "start": 53.12, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "United Nations General Assembly.", "start": 58.079, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "Your Majesties, Excellencies,", "start": 61.199, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "Heads of State and Government,", "start": 64.879, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the Secretary General of the United", "start": 68.159, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "Nations,", "start": 70.159, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Mr. Tonio Guterres,", "start": 71.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "distinguished delegates, ladies and", "start": 75.76, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "gentlemen,", "start": 78.08, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "I congratulate you,", "start": 80.64, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Dr. Raman on election", "start": 83.439, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "as president of the 8th first session of", "start": 86.88, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "the general assembly.", "start": 91.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Zimbabwe is confident", "start": 93.6, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "that under your able leadership, the", "start": 96.32, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "assembly will advance meaningful", "start": 99.04, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "transformation", "start": 101.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "under the theme restoring trust,", "start": 102.799, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "managing transformation.", "start": 107.2, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "A United Nations that delivers for all.", "start": 109.6, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "You may count on Zimbabwe's full", "start": 113.28, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "support.", "start": 116.079, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "I wish to thank Miss Analena", "start": 118.399, "duration": 7.281}, {"text": "Baba Bach for her effective leadership", "start": 122.719, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "of the 80th session and her contribution", "start": 125.68, "duration": 9.72}, {"text": "to the UN a reform process.", "start": 129.92, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "Zimbabwe also pays tribute to Mr.", "start": 136.8, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Antonio Gutes", "start": 141.28, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "in his final general debate as secretary", "start": 143.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "general.", "start": 146.48, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "We commend his defense of", "start": 148.0, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 150.4, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "as well as efforts to advance dialogue", "start": 152.48, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "for conflict prevention and resolution,", "start": 156.64, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "sustainable development and the pact for", "start": 159.92, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "the future. Mr. President, we meet", "start": 162.959, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "during a pivotal moment when the world", "start": 166.959, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "is facing numerous interconnected and", "start": 169.36, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "complex crisis.", "start": 173.36, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Conflicts are spreading, climate shocks", "start": 175.92, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "are intensifying,", "start": 179.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "and technology is advancing faster than", "start": 181.519, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "the rules that govern it.", "start": 184.56, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "As the current crop of leaders, it", "start": 187.44, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "should concern us that today somewhere a", "start": 189.519, "duration": 8.72}, {"text": "child is born into war. A family is", "start": 194.319, "duration": 8.321}, {"text": "displaced by conflict. A farmer loses", "start": 198.239, "duration": 8.161}, {"text": "another harvest to drought. And a young", "start": 202.64, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "person wonders whether technological", "start": 206.4, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "progress will expand opportunity or", "start": 209.519, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "deepen inequality.", "start": 212.159, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "through separated by geography. Though", "start": 216.239, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "separated by geography, these", "start": 219.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "experiences reveal a common truth.", "start": 221.36, "duration": 7.439}, {"text": "Humanity's challenges are increasingly", "start": 225.2, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "interconnected", "start": 228.799, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "and no nation can overcome them alone.", "start": 230.56, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "The trust deficit", "start": 235.44, "duration": 5.999}, {"text": "among nations has continued to erode the", "start": 237.84, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "gains that cooperation fostered within", "start": 241.439, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "the United Nations system. We must", "start": 245.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "therefore choose between purposeful", "start": 247.599, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "reform or unmitigated", "start": 250.959, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "repression.", "start": 254.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Trust will be restored when conflicts", "start": 256.479, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "are prevented.", "start": 259.28, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "International law is applied equally,", "start": 261.68, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "development commitments are fulfilled", "start": 265.52, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "and all nations are fairly represented", "start": 269.12, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "in global institutions.", "start": 272.479, "duration": 8.241}, {"text": "Multateralism is a crucial equalizer.", "start": 276.08, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "It ensures that all have an equal voice", "start": 280.72, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "under international law and an equal", "start": 283.6, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "role in shaping our shared future.", "start": 286.639, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Undoubtedly,", "start": 291.04, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "the charter remains our common compass,", "start": 292.8, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "sovereign equality, political", "start": 296.639, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "independence,", "start": 299.04, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "territorial integrity, non-inference,", "start": 300.639, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "peaceful settlement of disputes and", "start": 304.4, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "international cooperation must be", "start": 307.12, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "applied universally, not selectively.", "start": 309.12, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "International law cannot be a shield for", "start": 314.56, "duration": 8.24}, {"text": "some and a sword against others.", "start": 318.0, "duration": 8.88}, {"text": "The United Nations has a sacred duty to", "start": 322.8, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "serve succeeding generations from the", "start": 326.88, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "scourge of war.", "start": 329.199, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "Our experience in southern Africa", "start": 331.52, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "has taught us that dialogue is a shared", "start": 334.56, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "fortitude", "start": 338.08, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "and not a weakness.", "start": 339.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "In the African tradition, the meeting", "start": 342.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "place is not where courage is abandoned.", "start": 344.88, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "It is where wisdom is summoned.", "start": 347.84, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Lessons can be drawn from the", "start": 352.16, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "heritage-based approaches to peace", "start": 354.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "building", "start": 357.199, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "and conflict resolution from communities", "start": 359.36, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "across the world, including within", "start": 362.16, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "Africa.", "start": 364.08, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "Military action may alter the", "start": 365.6, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "battlefield, but durable peace is built", "start": 367.44, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "through inclusive political processes", "start": 370.4, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "that restore confidence, address", "start": 373.039, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "grievances, and allow affected", "start": 375.84, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "communities to shape their soio,", "start": 378.16, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "economic, and political destinies.", "start": 380.479, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "Mr. President Zimbabwe is grateful for", "start": 384.319, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "the confidence placed in us through our", "start": 387.68, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "election to the Security Council for the", "start": 391.68, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "2027 to 2028 ter.", "start": 394.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "My country will assume this", "start": 398.96, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "responsibility in January 2027 with", "start": 400.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "humility, independency,", "start": 403.6, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "and a readiness to serve, guided by", "start": 406.56, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "foreign policy of being a friend to all", "start": 410.8, "duration": 7.839}, {"text": "and an enemy to none. Accordingly,", "start": 414.72, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "my country", "start": 418.639, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "will prioritize four priorities in the", "start": 420.96, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "council. Firstly, the promotion of", "start": 424.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "preventive diplomacy,", "start": 427.28, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "mediation and peaceful dispute", "start": 430.16, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "resolution", "start": 432.24, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "while tackling the underlining causes of", "start": 433.919, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "insecurity.", "start": 436.56, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Secondly, we shall advocate for the", "start": 438.319, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "strengthening of cooperation between the", "start": 441.52, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "United Nations and the regional", "start": 443.919, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "organizations such as the African Union", "start": 446.08, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "and its peace and security council.", "start": 449.199, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "In this respect,", "start": 452.72, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "we call for the full implementation of", "start": 455.28, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "resolution 2719", "start": 457.759, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "to ensure predictable, adequate and", "start": 460.08, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "sustainable financing for authorized", "start": 464.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "African Unionled peace support", "start": 467.36, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "operations.", "start": 469.68, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "Thirdly,", "start": 471.919, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "our nation believes that our rich", "start": 473.68, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "heritage and natural resource endments", "start": 476.0, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "must advance industrialization,", "start": 479.599, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "modernization", "start": 482.24, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "and the green agenda for the prosperity", "start": 483.759, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "of all and not to finance conflict.", "start": 486.319, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "As such, Zimbabwe shall support Africa", "start": 491.52, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "silencing the guns agenda and strong", "start": 494.4, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "action against terrorism, organized", "start": 498.0, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "crime, elicit arms flows and illegal", "start": 501.039, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "resource trafficking. Finally,", "start": 505.199, "duration": 9.121}, {"text": "women and young people must share peace", "start": 508.8, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "from the outset.", "start": 514.32, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "The support of Zimbabwe will also be", "start": 516.64, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "extended to the women and youth peace", "start": 518.88, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "and security agendas.", "start": 521.2, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "The current times demand peacekeeping", "start": 524.0, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "that is grounded in clear political", "start": 527.12, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "strategies, realistic mandates and", "start": 530.64, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "adequate resources.", "start": 534.399, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Those most affected by the decisions of", "start": 536.959, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "the security council should not be the", "start": 540.16, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "least heard.", "start": 542.48, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "There is need not only", "start": 544.959, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "give a voice but consider the views of", "start": 547.839, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "the countries and regions on the", "start": 550.64, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "security council agenda towards a sh our", "start": 552.399, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "shared aspirations for ensuring peace", "start": 555.839, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "and sustainable development. Mr.", "start": 558.8, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "President,", "start": 561.36, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "restoring confidence in collective", "start": 562.959, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "security requires the Security Council", "start": 565.519, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "to move beyond the outdated geopolitical", "start": 568.8, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "realities of 1945.", "start": 573.12, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "The longstanding position of Africa", "start": 576.399, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "is outlined in the Eolene convent", "start": 580.24, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "consensus and the city declaration", "start": 583.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "should be granted.", "start": 585.92, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Africa is united, sovereign and", "start": 588.24, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "independent.", "start": 592.08, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Africa is rising.", "start": 593.839, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "The horse and the rider mentality has no", "start": 596.16, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "place in the contempor discourse.", "start": 598.64, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "Zimbabwe reaffirms that in institutional", "start": 603.44, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "legitimacy depends on the consistent", "start": 607.04, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "application of international law,", "start": 610.0, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "sovereign equality and the inaliable", "start": 612.8, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "right to self-determination", "start": 616.88, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "of all within the committee of nations.", "start": 618.959, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "Unilateral coercive measures as a", "start": 622.48, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "manipulative foreign policy tool are", "start": 626.0, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "outdated in a global era which should be", "start": 628.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "encountered on solidarity,", "start": 632.88, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "mutually beneficial partnerships and", "start": 635.44, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "shared prosperity.", "start": 637.839, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "I urge us to use this defining apple in", "start": 640.56, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "the history of August organization to", "start": 644.64, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "protect the United Nations charter.", "start": 647.92, "duration": 8.32}, {"text": "The tendencies where our resolutions in", "start": 652.48, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "international law are ignored should no", "start": 656.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "longer be excused.", "start": 659.519, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "Mr. President, peace cannot endure", "start": 662.399, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "without development.", "start": 667.12, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "With less than four years to implement", "start": 669.36, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "the 23rd agenda, only 36% of the", "start": 671.92, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "sustainable development goals are on", "start": 676.24, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "track or or showing moderate progress.", "start": 678.959, "duration": 7.361}, {"text": "While developing countries face an", "start": 683.92, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "annual financing gap exceeding US4 $4", "start": 686.32, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "trillion,", "start": 690.64, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "the civil commitment must now be", "start": 694.16, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "implemented through greater afford", "start": 696.72, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "affordable long-term and concessional", "start": 698.88, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "finance timely", "start": 701.839, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "developmentoriented debt treatment", "start": 704.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and a more effective channeling or", "start": 707.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "special drawing rights.", "start": 710.48, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Development cannot flourish when its", "start": 713.04, "duration": 8.16}, {"text": "financing is prohibitively expensive.", "start": 715.68, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "Reform must decisively address Africa's", "start": 721.2, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "excessive risk premiums and borrowing", "start": 724.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "costs.", "start": 728.079, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "The need to strengthen the voice of", "start": 729.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "developing countries in global financial", "start": 732.24, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "institutions, cap illicit financial", "start": 734.959, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "flows and tax abuse as well as secure", "start": 737.68, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "fair returns from natural resources", "start": 742.56, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "cannot be overemphasized.", "start": 745.6, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "Zimbabwe is continuously strengthening", "start": 749.839, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "its capacity to mobilize domestic", "start": 752.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "resources, enhance public financial", "start": 754.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "management and foster a favorable", "start": 758.0, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "environment for productive investment.", "start": 760.959, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "Under our national vision 2030,", "start": 765.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "we are strengthening the important", "start": 768.72, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "linkage between mining and agriculture", "start": 770.72, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "which is driving growth in Zimbabwe's", "start": 774.959, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "manufacturing sector.", "start": 777.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Bold reforms", "start": 780.399, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and under macroeconomic policies have", "start": 783.12, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "resulted in a three-fold growth in our", "start": 786.399, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "GDP since 2017.", "start": 789.44, "duration": 8.079}, {"text": "Zimbabwe is indeed open for business.", "start": 792.72, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "We are also pursuing food and nutrition", "start": 797.519, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "security and a climate smart", "start": 800.079, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "agriculture.", "start": 802.72, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "My government is leaving no one and no", "start": 804.48, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "place behind through our rural", "start": 807.2, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "industrialization agenda and the invest", "start": 810.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "rural policy. We are directing", "start": 813.92, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "investment towards rural infrastructure,", "start": 816.8, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "manufacturing hubs and agro processing", "start": 820.32, "duration": 6.519}, {"text": "facilities.", "start": 823.839, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "More women and youth continue to enter", "start": 827.04, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "value chain industries for both our", "start": 829.839, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "local and regional markets.", "start": 832.48, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "As droughts, floods, and declining", "start": 835.68, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "productivity threaten water, food and", "start": 838.959, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "energy security, developed countries are", "start": 842.079, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "called upon to honor their climate", "start": 845.12, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "finance commitments", "start": 848.32, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "in line with", "start": 850.639, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "common but differentiated", "start": 853.12, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "responsibilities.", "start": 855.76, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "Mr. President", "start": 857.279, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Zimbabwe welcomes the recommendations", "start": 859.36, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "of the Secretary General's panel on", "start": 862.88, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "critical energy transition minerals and", "start": 865.6, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "the country support mechanism.", "start": 868.959, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Critical minerals must become a", "start": 871.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "foundation for inclusive development", "start": 874.079, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "with valuation and a beneficiation", "start": 877.36, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "at source", "start": 880.639, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "along with development of regional value", "start": 882.399, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "chains being highly prioritized.", "start": 884.8, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Zimbabwe has more than 40 critical and", "start": 889.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "rare earth minerals and we have made", "start": 891.68, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "bold decisions towards a mutually", "start": 894.8, "duration": 7.88}, {"text": "beneficial extractive industry.", "start": 897.839, "duration": 4.841}, {"text": "This has seen us dispatch the first", "start": 903.839, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "export of locally produced lithium", "start": 907.36, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "sulfate", "start": 910.16, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "during the second quarter of the year,", "start": 911.76, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "demonstrating that remaining value at", "start": 914.72, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "the source, retaining value at the", "start": 917.279, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "source is possible for shared", "start": 919.92, "duration": 6.039}, {"text": "prosperity.", "start": 922.959, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Harnessing emerging technologies for", "start": 926.72, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "national development is a key priority", "start": 929.199, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "for industrialization agenda.", "start": 932.399, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Zimbabwe's national artificial", "start": 935.6, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "intelligence strategy 2026 to 2030", "start": 938.0, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "promotes human centered ethical and", "start": 942.079, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "responsible innovation.", "start": 944.959, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Artificial intelligence must narrow", "start": 947.519, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "development gaps while its military use", "start": 949.839, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "including in nuclear command and control", "start": 953.6, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "must remain subject to human judgment,", "start": 957.68, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "accountability", "start": 960.639, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "and international law.", "start": 962.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Regrettably, however, my country's", "start": 964.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "national development initiatives have", "start": 967.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "continued to be undermined by unilateral", "start": 970.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "coercive measures imposed by some", "start": 973.36, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "western countries.", "start": 975.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "We call for their immediate and", "start": 977.92, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "unconditional removal. I reiterate", "start": 979.92, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Zimbabwe is a friend to all and enemy to", "start": 982.8, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "none unless you choose to be an enemy.", "start": 985.44, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "Civil, political and economic, social", "start": 990.0, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "and cultural rights require equal", "start": 992.32, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "protection", "start": 994.639, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "and are best advanced through dialogue,", "start": 996.16, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "cooperation, capacity building and", "start": 999.68, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "national ownership.", "start": 1002.48, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "On the 40th anniversary of the", "start": 1004.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "declaration of the right to development,", "start": 1006.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Zimbabwe calls for the adoption and", "start": 1009.519, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "translation of its principles into", "start": 1012.72, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "binding international commitments.", "start": 1016.16, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "Racism and all forms of discrimination", "start": 1019.68, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "continue to deny millions the equal", "start": 1023.44, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "enjoyment of human rights and", "start": 1025.919, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "development.", "start": 1027.919, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Accountability, education and awareness,", "start": 1029.439, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "as well as support for victims and", "start": 1032.72, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "engagement on reparatory justice remain", "start": 1035.039, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "critical pathways to truth,", "start": 1038.799, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "healing, restored dignity and equality.", "start": 1042.0, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "My country therefore", "start": 1046.88, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "joins other member states in calling for", "start": 1049.2, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "the full implementation of the devon", "start": 1051.6, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "declaration and program of action. Mr.", "start": 1054.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "President,", "start": 1058.32, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Zimbabwe supports UN8 reforms that", "start": 1060.24, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "reduce duplication,", "start": 1064.64, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "improve coordination, modernize systems", "start": 1066.96, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "and strengthen field implementation.", "start": 1070.08, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "At this juncture of global development,", "start": 1074.0, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "the success of reforms should be", "start": 1077.44, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "reflected by the conflicts prevented,", "start": 1079.52, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "development advanced,", "start": 1083.12, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "assistance delivered, and communities", "start": 1085.28, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "strengthened.", "start": 1088.4, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "The selection of the next secretary", "start": 1090.48, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "general, therefore, comes at a defining", "start": 1092.16, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "moment.", "start": 1095.2, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "The next holder of the office should be", "start": 1096.72, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "an impartial custodian of the charter,", "start": 1100.24, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "an independent voice for peace, a bridge", "start": 1103.76, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "builder among member states, and an", "start": 1107.84, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "advocate for those whose voices seldom", "start": 1110.96, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "reach these walls.", "start": 1114.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "The process should be transparent,", "start": 1117.36, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "inclusive, and guided by merit,", "start": 1119.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "equitable geographical representation", "start": 1122.799, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "and gender equality.", "start": 1125.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Above all, the next secretary general", "start": 1128.32, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "must bring the United Nations closer to", "start": 1131.36, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "the people. The charter begins with we", "start": 1133.919, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "the peoples of the United Nations. Those", "start": 1137.76, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "words should guide how the organization", "start": 1140.88, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "listens, how it communicates", "start": 1144.0, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "and how it measures the success. In", "start": 1147.6, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "conclusion, Zimbabwe will assume its", "start": 1150.96, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "role in the security council, mindful", "start": 1153.6, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "that membership is not a badge of honor,", "start": 1156.32, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "but a commitment to serve the committee", "start": 1160.0, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "of nations.", "start": 1162.32, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "We will serve with balance in the", "start": 1164.32, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "integrity, defend the sovereign equality", "start": 1166.88, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "of states, advance Africa's priorities,", "start": 1169.84, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "and work constructively with all", "start": 1173.679, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "regions.", "start": 1176.24, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Let this 81st session be recorded as the", "start": 1177.919, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "session that closed the gap between the", "start": 1182.72, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "promises of the charter and the", "start": 1185.679, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "realities of the daily life.", "start": 1187.919, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "Zimbabwe is ready to play its part in", "start": 1191.28, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "building the future we all want. God", "start": 1193.36, "duration": 7.319}, {"text": "bless you all. I thank you.", "start": 1196.16, "duration": 4.519}, {"text": "On behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 1210.32, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "thank the President of the Republic of", "start": 1213.12, "duration": 5.799}, {"text": "Zimbabwe.", "start": 1215.919, "duration": 3.0}]